msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/durationValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "durationValue is functional"
msgstr "durationValue 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/durationValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:durationValue is functional: a gmeow:Duration has exactly one length expressed as an xsd:duration literal, of which the TEO normalized-duration string is a projection."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:durationValue 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Duration 恰好有一个以 xsd:duration 字面量表达的长度，TEO 规范化时长字符串是其投影。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTemporalFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "eventTemporalFrame is functional"
msgstr "eventTemporalFrame 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTemporalFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:eventTemporalFrame is functional: a gmeow:Event's date or interval is expressed in exactly one temporal frame (Principle 11), a single reference frame that disambiguates the event's timing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:eventTemporalFrame 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Event 的日期或区间恰好以一个时间参照系表达（原则 11），即消除该事件时间歧义的单一参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/participationEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "participationEvent is functional"
msgstr "participationEvent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/participationEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationEvent is functional: a gmeow:Participation is part of exactly one event, so participation in another event is a distinct participation relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationEvent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Participation 恰好是一个事件的一部分,因此参与另一事件将构成一个不同的参与关系元。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recurrenceRuleTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "recurrenceRuleText is functional"
msgstr "recurrenceRuleText 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recurrenceRuleTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:recurrenceRuleText is functional: a gmeow:RecurrenceRule carries exactly one RFC 5545 RRULE string, projected directly to a single iCalendar RRULE."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:recurrenceRuleText 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:RecurrenceRule 恰好携带一个 RFC 5545 RRULE 字符串,直接投影为唯一的一个 iCalendar RRULE。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/subEventOfTransitivity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "subEventOf is transitive"
msgstr "「subEventOf」具有传递性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/subEventOfTransitivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:subEventOf is transitive: a part of a part is a part — the reading its own skos:definition commits to (CIDOC-CRM P9). The native coherence gate reads this to close the sub-event relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:subEventOf 是传递的：部分的部分即是部分——这是其自身 skos:definition 所承诺的解读（CIDOC-CRM P9）。原生一致性关卡读取此项以闭合子事件关系。"
